@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### System info
GET {{baseUrl}}/furnispace/api/v1/
Accept: application/json
X-Trace-Id: local-development

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Database health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/furnispace/api/v1/health/database

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/furnispace/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "fullName": "FurniSpace Customer",
  "phoneNumber": "081234567890"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/furnispace/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/furnispace/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
